-----------------------------------------------------------------------
DERIVED WORK NOTICE
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
This release (AxialFlowNet) is a research derivative of the
pytorch-CycleGAN-and-pix2pix codebase (https://github.com/junyanz/pytorch-CycleGAN-and-pix2pix),
Copyright (c) 2017, Jun-Yan Zhu and Taesung Park, released under the license above.

Modifications carried over into this package include, among others:
  * models/axialflownet_model.py   -- geometric flow-field generator (flow branch
    plus bounded texture residual branch) and the axial-monotonicity, SSIM/Sobel
    structural and flow-regularization losses;
  * models/axial_d_networks.py     -- axial multi-scale discriminator;
  * models/flow_head.py            -- flow prediction head and warp_with_flow;
  * data/xunliti_paired_dataset.py -- paired dataset preserving native aspect ratio
    via reflect padding;
  * scripts/inference.py, scripts/destretch3d.py, scripts/evaluate_paired.py
    -- inference and evaluation tooling.

All original copyright notices, license conditions and the disclaimers above are
preserved in full as required by this license. The added modules are distributed
under the same BSD-3-Clause terms.
